NOTE ON GAME DATA:

This license covers the DOSSAGE port source in this repository (build
system, scripts, port-specific code, patches, documentation).

Unlike the MIT source above, the vendored Passage engine (`vendor/passage/`)
and its minorGems dependency (`vendor/minorgems/`), and the game's own
graphics/music data, are placed in the PUBLIC DOMAIN by their author, Jason
Rohrer -- see LICENSE-REVIEW.md for the verified sources. Nothing in this
repository imposes copyleft on the distributed DOSSAGE.EXE binary or its
bundled data; the MIT notice above applies to the original, non-derivative
port glue, and the public-domain status of Passage/minorGems applies to
everything derived from or vendoring those trees.

See PLAN.md's "Locked decisions" and LICENSE-REVIEW.md for the complete
analysis.
